{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:656b8587db9184bf","name":"Shield Gauntlet","source":{"id":"source:reference-656b8587db9184bf","title":"Shield Gauntlet","revision":20768,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:28:46Z","sha256":"8cd64c5d5537cc7fefe1afcf646e92611658bb252ccf9b4f558ee0e870b25f96","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20768","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Shield%20Gauntlet&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-656b8587db9184bf","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["While ",{"tag":"a","children":["Energy Shields"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Energy_Shields","referenceId":"reference:98d76f0e28772518"}," have fallen out of use in much of the galaxy, they can still be found among the nobility of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kilia IV"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kilia_IV?action=edit&redlink=1"},". ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Kilian Rangers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Kilian_Rangers","referenceId":"reference:213d5b285472d1c3"}," use Shield Gauntlets to both provide defense and remind themselves and others of the other half of their oaths; to defend themselves and their families. A Shield Gauntlet can be worn even if you are wearing other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"},", although you cannot wear any items that cover your hands (such as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Combat Gloves"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Combat_Gloves","referenceId":"reference:2bd4897a780f381e"},", a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stunning Gauntlet"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stunning_Gauntlet","referenceId":"reference:bad45a025bb351a0"},", a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cortosis Gauntlet"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cortosis_Gauntlet","refere